/* Codex CLI theme — source-verified from openai/codex (Rust workspace
 * codex-rs/tui/) commit c03cea4 (2026-05-15).
 *
 * Cited tokens (from source code, not branding):
 *   accent (dark bg):       Cyan + BOLD              tui/src/style.rs:44
 *   accent (light bg):      RGB(0,95,135) + BOLD     tui/src/style.rs:9,42
 *   diff add fg:            Green                    tui/src/diff_render.rs:1231
 *   diff del fg:            Red                      tui/src/diff_render.rs:1243
 *   user prefix:            `›` bold dim             tui/src/history_cell/messages.rs:170
 *   tool detail prefix:     `  └ `                   tui/src/status_indicator_widget.rs:35
 *   quote gutter:           `  │ `                   tui/src/insert_history.rs:634
 *
 * Codex is deliberately borderless prose — borders appear only on
 * onboarding/modal/markdown table surfaces. We honour that here:
 * top-level chrome uses backgrounds and color rules, not boxes.
 *
 * IMPORTANT: We do NOT redefine Textual's standard color tokens
 * ($accent, $surface, $panel, …). Doing so corrupts Textual's
 * internal default CSS (e.g. `Screen.-maximized-view`'s `hatch: right
 * $panel`). Style our own widget classes by id/type instead.
 */

Breadcrumb {
    color: cyan;
    text-style: bold;
}

FooterHints {
    color: $text-muted;
}

StatusBar {
    color: $text-muted;
}

#home-list {
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
}

#sessions-table,
#timeline-table {
    border: none;
}

#event-detail {
    padding: 0 1;
}

InlinePrompt {
    background: $surface;
}

InlinePrompt > Static.prompt-label {
    color: cyan;
    text-style: bold;
}
